g++ and clang++ accept this program: a class may have the same
non-virtual base more than once (N5008 [class.mi]/3).  The rejection this
test pins is a front-end limitation, tracked by the KNOWNBUG
cpp_repeated_non_virtual_base_subobjects; delete this test when that is
fixed.
